<title>UK: TABLE-Argos H1 pre-tax profits falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Argos H1 pre-tax profits falls.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty four weeks to June 14, 1997.</p>
<p>			(million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		    6.76	     vs     7.06</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	     6.10	     vs     5.3</p>
<p> Pretax			  28.08	     vs    31.80</p>
<p> Turnover		     627.23	     vs   561.32</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 25.5 and 31.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Argos Plc.</p>
